{"kind":"article","sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Add the package, configure RevenueCat, register the paywall plugin, and present the bundled sheets."}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall"}],"role":"article","title":"Getting Started with SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall","roleHeading":"Article"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This guide walks through the four steps to integrate ","type":"text"},{"code":"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" into a Swidux app: add the package, configure RevenueCat, register the plugin, and attach the UI. It is the shortest path from a wired Swidux app to a working paywall. For deeper coverage of any step, follow the linked how-tos.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This package assumes you already use Swidux. If you don’t, work through Swidux’s own getting-started guide first.","type":"text"}]},{"level":2,"text":"Add the Package","type":"heading","anchor":"Add-the-Package"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Xcode:"}]},{"type":"text","text":" File > Add Package Dependencies, paste "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"https:\/\/github.com\/HeirloomLogic\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall"},{"type":"text","text":". Add the products you need:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" — the ","type":"text"},{"code":"PaywallService","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation and mock."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywallUI","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" — adds the "},{"code":"revenueCatPaywall","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"code":"revenueCatCustomerCenter","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" view modifiers (depends on RevenueCatUI)."}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Package.swift:"}]}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":[".package(url: \"https:\/\/github.com\/HeirloomLogic\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\", from: \"1.0.0\"),"]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":[".product(name: \"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\", package: \"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\"),",".product(name: \"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywallUI\", package: \"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\"),"]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Configure the paywall at launch","anchor":"Configure-the-paywall-at-launch"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"RevenueCatPaywallService","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" calls into ","type":"text"},{"code":"Purchases.shared","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" under the hood. Configure the paywall before constructing the store:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["\/\/ MyApp.swift","import SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall","import SwiftUI","","@main","struct MyApp: App {","    @State private var store: AppStore","","    init() {","        RevenueCatPaywall.configure(apiKey: \"your_revenuecat_api_key\")","        _store = State(wrappedValue: AppStore.configured())","    }","","    var body: some Scene {","        WindowGroup { ContentView().environment(store) }","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The service itself is safe to construct before configuration. If stored-property initialization creates the store first, configure RevenueCat before dispatching paywall actions. An early read or restore throws ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/RevenueCatPaywallError\/notConfigured","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":"; an early entitlement stream finishes and can be started again after configuration. Swidux 1.9 and later clears the plugin’s observation guard when that stream ends.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Pass ","type":"text"},{"code":"appUserID","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"userDefaults","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (for app-group sharing with widgets), ","type":"text"},{"code":"logLevel","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"entitlementVerification","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (signed entitlement verification), or ","type":"text"},{"code":"purchasesAreCompletedBy","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"\/","type":"text"},{"code":"storeKitVersion","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (app-completed purchases) if you need them — see ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/RevenueCatPaywall\/configure(apiKey:appUserID:userDefaults:logLevel:entitlementVerification:purchasesAreCompletedBy:storeKitVersion:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Register the paywall plugin","anchor":"Register-the-paywall-plugin"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Pass ","type":"text"},{"code":"RevenueCatPaywallService","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to ","type":"text"},{"code":"PaywallPlugin","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" in your ","type":"text"},{"code":"Store.configured()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" factory:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["import Swidux","import SwiduxPaywall","import SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall","","extension Store where State == AppState, Action == AppAction {","    static func configured() -> AppStore {","        let plugins = PluginHost<AppState, AppAction>()","","        plugins.register(","            PaywallPlugin<AppState, AppAction>(","                state: \\.paywall,","                action: AppAction.paywall,","                extractAction: { if case .paywall(let a) = $0 { return a }; return nil },","                service: ResilientPaywallService(","                    base: RevenueCatPaywallService(entitlementID: \"pro\"),","                    store: KeychainKeyValueStore(service: \"com.example.myapp\")","                )","            )","        )","","        return Store(","            initialState: AppState(),","            reducer: AppReducer().reduce,","            plugins: plugins","        )","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ResilientPaywallService"},{"type":"text","text":" (from SwiduxPaywall) persists the last entitlement snapshot a successful read delivered. Without it, a slow or failing network at cold launch leaves "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PaywallState"},{"type":"text","text":" at its free default and gates paying users out of their features until the first successful read; with it, the last-known-good state holds until live data arrives, and the server stays authoritative — a genuine lapse is honoured on the next successful read. Wrap the RevenueCat service in it for production."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Back the cache with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"KeychainKeyValueStore"},{"type":"text","text":", as shown, rather than "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UserDefaultsKeyValueStore"},{"type":"text","text":". The cache vouches for a paid entitlement while RevenueCat is unreachable, and a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UserDefaults"},{"type":"text","text":" plist is user-editable and restorable from a doctored backup; the Keychain uses OS-protected storage instead of a user-editable plist. See Swidux’s "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/heirloomlogic.github.io\/Swidux\/documentation\/swidux\/securityposture"},{"type":"text","text":" for what the cache does and does not defend against."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Start the entitlement stream on the root view so the gate reflects RevenueCat’s state from launch:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["struct ContentView: View {","    @Environment(AppStore.self) private var store","","    var body: some View {","        RootContent()","            .task {","                store.send(.paywall(.observeCustomerInfo))","                store.send(.paywall(.refreshCustomerInfo))","            }","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Gate features by reading "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"store.paywall.isGateSatisfied"},{"type":"text","text":". See "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/HowToImplementService"},{"type":"text","text":" for the full plugin lifecycle."}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Attach the UI","anchor":"Attach-the-UI"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Attach the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"revenueCatPaywall"},{"type":"text","text":" modifier to a root view, driven by paywall state:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["import SwiduxRevenueCatPaywallUI","","struct RootView: View {","    @Environment(AppStore.self) private var store","","    var body: some View {","        ContentView()","            .revenueCatPaywall(state: store.paywall) { action in","                store.send(.paywall(action))","            }","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Trigger the paywall from a gated feature with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".paywall(.request(reason:))"},{"type":"text","text":":"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["Button(\"Export PDF\") {","    if store.paywall.isGateSatisfied {","        store.send(.export(.exportPDF))","    } else {","        store.send(.paywall(.request(reason: \"export-pdf\")))","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"See "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/HowToPresentTheUI"},{"type":"text","text":" for manual wiring with the primitive modifiers, customer-center triggering, and dismiss semantics."}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Next Steps","anchor":"Next-Steps"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/HowToImplementService","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" — Detailed walkthrough of the service lifecycle and error handling."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/HowToAddAPermanentLicense","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" — Add a lifetime entitlement alongside the subscription."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/HowToPreviewAndTest","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" — Drive entitlement state from previews and tests."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/HowToPresentTheUI","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" — Wire the bundled view modifiers."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/PlatformBehavior","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" — Why iOS and macOS behave differently."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/EntitlementMapping","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" — How RevenueCat entitlements map to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EntitlementSnapshot"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]}]}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/GettingStarted","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/swiduxrevenuecatpaywall\/gettingstarted"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"references":{"doc://SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/documentation/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/HowToPresentTheUI":{"kind":"article","abstract":[{"text":"Attach the ","type":"text"},{"code":"revenueCatPaywall","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"revenueCatCustomerCenter","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" view modifiers from ","type":"text"},{"code":"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywallUI","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to a root view, driven by ","type":"text"},{"code":"PaywallState","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swiduxrevenuecatpaywall\/howtopresenttheui","role":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/HowToPresentTheUI","type":"topic","title":"How to Present the UI"},"doc://SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/documentation/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/RevenueCatPaywallError/notConfigured":{"type":"topic","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxrevenuecatpaywall\/revenuecatpaywallerror\/notconfigured","fragments":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"notConfigured","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/RevenueCatPaywallError\/notConfigured","kind":"symbol","title":"RevenueCatPaywallError.notConfigured","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"RevenueCat has not been configured, so the requested operation cannot start."}]},"https://heirloomlogic.github.io/Swidux/documentation/swidux/securityposture":{"type":"link","title":"Security Posture","titleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Security Posture"}],"identifier":"https:\/\/heirloomlogic.github.io\/Swidux\/documentation\/swidux\/securityposture","url":"https:\/\/heirloomlogic.github.io\/Swidux\/documentation\/swidux\/securityposture"},"doc://SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/documentation/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/HowToImplementService":{"abstract":[{"text":"Wire ","type":"text"},{"code":"RevenueCatPaywallService","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" into the ","type":"text"},{"code":"SwiduxPaywall","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" plugin so the store sees real-time entitlement updates from RevenueCat.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swiduxrevenuecatpaywall\/howtoimplementservice","role":"article","type":"topic","kind":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/HowToImplementService","title":"How to Implement the Service"},"doc://SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/documentation/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/RevenueCatPaywall/configure(apiKey:appUserID:userDefaults:logLevel:entitlementVerification:purchasesAreCompletedBy:storeKitVersion:)":{"abstract":[{"text":"Configures the underlying purchase provider.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swiduxrevenuecatpaywall\/revenuecatpaywall\/configure(apikey:appuserid:userdefaults:loglevel:entitlementverification:purchasesarecompletedby:storekitversion:)","role":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"configure","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"apiKey","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"appUserID","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"userDefaults","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"UserDefaults","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSUserDefaults","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?, ","